<navigation-bar id="about-navigation" title="{{section==='privacy'?'隐私与资料处理':section==='photos'?'照片与AI使用说明':section==='functions'?'功能说明':section==='filing'?'备案信息':'关于与隐私'}}" back="{{false}}" color="#3d302a" background="transparent"><view slot="left" class="my-nav" bindtap="goBack"><view></view></view></navigation-bar><scroll-view class="my-scroll" scroll-y enhanced show-scrollbar="{{false}}"><view class="my-shell">
 <block wx:if="{{!section}}"><view class="my-card brand-card"><image class="brand-mark" src="/assets/app-brand-icon-v1.jpg" mode="aspectFit"/><text class="brand-name">宝宝辅食识别规划大师</text><text class="my-sub">把每一餐，照顾得刚刚好</text><text class="my-small">{{versionText}}</text></view><view class="my-card about-links"><view id="about-privacy" class="my-row" data-section="privacy" bindtap="openSection"><view class="my-icon-box"><view class="my-icon lock"></view></view><text class="my-label">隐私与资料处理</text><text class="my-chevron">›</text></view><view id="about-photos" class="my-row" data-section="photos" bindtap="openSection"><view class="my-icon-box"><view class="my-icon camera"></view></view><text class="my-label">照片与AI使用说明</text><text class="my-chevron">›</text></view><view id="about-functions" class="my-row" data-section="functions" bindtap="openSection"><view class="my-icon-box"><view class="my-icon info"></view></view><text class="my-label">功能说明</text><text class="my-chevron">›</text></view><view id="about-feedback" class="my-row" bindtap="openFeedback"><view class="my-icon-box"><view class="my-icon message"></view></view><text class="my-label">联系与反馈</text><text class="my-chevron">›</text></view></view><view class="my-disclosure"><view class="my-disclosure-toggle" data-section="filing" bindtap="openSection"><text>备案信息</text><text>›</text></view></view></block>
 <block wx:elif="{{section==='functions'}}"><view class="my-card"><text class="my-title">关于记录与参考</text><text class="my-sub about-copy">记录的是你确认的实际摄入。报告只对照已有资料，不等于全天吃下的全部食物。</text><view class="my-divider"></view><text class="my-sub">AI识别与菜单均需核对，不作为营养事实或医学判断。菜品图片只是示意，食材与用量以文字为准。</text></view><view class="my-card"><text class="my-title">你的资料</text><text class="my-sub about-copy">账号、宝宝与餐食访问按权限保护。照片保存期限、服务提供方、用途与处理方式以实际确认页面及隐私指引为准。</text><view class="my-divider"></view><text class="my-small">识别候选、食品身份和实际摄入量均需用户确认。拒绝图片授权不影响手工搜索和基础记录。</text></view></block>
 <block wx:elif="{{section==='privacy'}}"><view class="my-card"><text class="my-title">资料与访问</text><text class="my-sub about-copy">账号、宝宝和餐食资料按访问权限保护。识别、菜单和图片的用途在使用前说明，营养结果仅供日常参考。</text><view class="my-divider"></view><text class="my-sub">{{privacyText}}</text></view><view class="my-card"><text class="my-title">反馈资料</text><text class="my-sub about-copy">反馈文字、图片及联系方式仅用于反馈处理，不发送给AI。反馈保留180天，未提交图片最多保留1小时。</text><button id="about-privacy-contract" class="my-secondary" bindtap="openPrivacyContract">查看微信隐私保护指引</button></view></block>
 <block wx:elif="{{section==='photos'}}"><view class="my-card"><text class="my-title">拍照记录与照片保存</text><text class="my-sub about-copy">{{privacyText}}</text><view class="my-divider"></view><text class="my-sub">本地照片可选择30天、180天或365天保存，到期按本地清理规则移除。记录中的图片通过授权接口访问。</text></view><view class="my-card"><text class="my-title">AI候选与菜品示意图</text><text class="my-sub about-copy">识别及菜单使用现有DeepSeek服务生成待确认的候选。菜品示意图使用图片功能显示的服务提供方，仅作示意，非实物照片。</text><view class="my-divider"></view><text class="my-sub">具体发送内容、生成额度、重试及图片复用规则，请在对应功能的说明内查看。点赞与收藏分别执行，不把收藏当作已吃过或已耐受。</text></view><button class="my-secondary" bindtap="openPrivacyContract">查看微信隐私保护指引</button></block>
 <block wx:elif="{{section==='filing'}}"><view class="my-card"><text class="my-title">备案信息</text><view class="filing-line"><text>小程序备案</text><text selectable>{{miniProgramFilingNumber || '暂无备案信息'}}</text></view><view class="filing-line"><text>域名ICP备案</text><text selectable>{{icpFilingNumber || '暂无备案信息'}}</text></view><view class="filing-line"><text>公安联网备案</text><text selectable>{{publicSecurityFilingNumber || '暂无备案信息'}}</text></view><text class="my-small">foodmaster.asia · 备案信息以实际登记及后续更新为准。</text></view></block>
</view></scroll-view>